  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|-(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}|+5\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot 0-1\\cdot (-2))+(0\\cdot 0-(-2)\\cdot (-2))+5(0\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot (-2)) \\\\  & =2-4-20 \\\\  & =-22.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the corresponding parallelepiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ is\n\n$$\nV=|-22|=22.\n$$" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304818 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304819 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304820 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304821 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304822 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1041 "selection" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304818 13194139534710 true] [17592186304817 1110 #uuid "6455940b-7783-5ded-9621-05e5ec5fcb74" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304818 1034 "22" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304818 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534710 true] [17592186304818 1111 #uuid "3882ae5f-2c77-5f2a-b003-368de5ef9d61" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304819 1034 "26" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304819 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534710 true] [17592186304819 1111 #uuid "095180c4-959a-5657-9cc5-bd7ffdecbfce" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304820 1034 "11" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304820 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534710 true] [17592186304820 1111 #uuid "b4dafd37-ab0e-5b3b-aaf4-7139bb13cc96" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304821 1034 "14" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304821 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534710 true] [17592186304821 1111 #uuid "92bb3cf0-98e0-5849-9c53-b7052aef9ccf" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304822 1034 "32" 13194139534710 true] [17592186304822 1103 #edb/re